OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fevening with sunny spells, although
OL,7,Fisolated showers are possible over the
OL,8,FPeak District. Cloud thickening
OL,9,Fovernight with rain arriving from the
OL,10,Fnorthwest, perhaps reaching all parts
OL,11,Fby dawn. Rain could be occasionally
OL,12,Fheavy in the north. Mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA wet start with outbreaks
OL,15,Fof rain, occasionally heavy. Perhaps
OL,16,Fsome brief drier spells during the
OL,17,Fafternoon and evening but remaining
OL,18,Fmostly cloudy until late. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
